- Chart Type: [line/bar/pie/etc.]
- Title: [suggested title based on context]
- Professional banking/fintech styling
- Clear labels and formatting for Teams UI

Context: [Brief explanation of why this visualization is needed]
```

**ANALYSIS DELEGATION - COMPLETE FORMAT:**
```
Forecasting-Data-Analyst-Agent: Perform [specific analysis type] with full context:

